        <detaileddescription>
<para>Export as Mermaid erDiagram syntax.</para>
<para>The output is a valid Mermaid <computeroutput>erDiagram</computeroutput> block that can be embedded in Markdown fences:</para>
<para>Relationship cardinality notation:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>graph_edge relationships use <computeroutput>||--o{</computeroutput> (one-to-many)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>when from_table == to_table the edge is rendered as <computeroutput>}o--o{</computeroutput> (many-to-many)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
